  "translatedBlocks": 10,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b2cf0ad4983df804",
      "translationZh": "介绍 InferBench：一项测试前沿 LLM 能否从用户指令中准确推断其优先事项的基准。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d9d7f3d3cf456be2",
      "translationZh": "我们在 20 个场景中，通过 2.8k 次对话测试了 12 个 LLM，以了解哪些模型能理解用户的目标。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cd64941e951cc3ad",
      "translationZh": "每次对话都有一位模拟用户，其优先事项记录在一份不公开的用户档案中。助手需要决定最佳选项，也可以先提出澄清问题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "73d293e377ee18a1",
      "translationZh": "当用户一开始就明确说明自己的优先事项时，模型有 89% 的情况下选中了最佳选项。如果部分优先事项最初没有说明，准确率就降到了 60%。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7dca59f9d901443f",
      "translationZh": "开放权重模型的表现比我预期的更好：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cdd40dc2674b21cc",
      "translationZh": "当偏好没有说明时，Astra 总会提出澄清问题；而当偏好已说明时，它从不这样做（极其令人印象深刻）。相比之下，Grok 4.6 在 18/64 次对话中请求澄清。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e7331d383b10a03b",
      "translationZh": "然而，LLM 在出错时仍然同样自信。105/288 个错误决策是在置信度 >90% 的情况下提交的。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b3f5aa7ef856c4cd",
      "translationZh": "完整报告链接在这里：https://laugh.so/research/inferbench/",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "631405e2fbc67a23",
      "translationZh": "最让你感到惊讶的是什么？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
